{
  "uid": "seatrush-checkout",
  "title": "SeatRush / Checkout SAGA",
  "description": "The orchestrated checkout of README section 8.3, from the command that starts it to the ticket. Read it top down: how many checkouts there are, how long they take, and what happened to the ones that did not confirm.\n\nAlmost everything here is normally flat. Compensations, late replies and duplicates are the designed answers to failure (README section 16), so they are not faults in themselves; what matters is their shape against the throughput beside them. The one panel that must stay at zero is the stuck checkouts, because that is the only state in this system with no automatic answer left.\n\nProvisioned from deploy/grafana/dashboards; edits in this UI are not saved back.",
  "tags": [
    "seatrush"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Throughput",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Checkouts per second",
      "description": "Every checkout that reached a terminal state, confirmed or not, counted where its duration is recorded.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "seatrush-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "seatrush-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(seatrush_saga_duration_seconds_count[$__rate_interval]))",
          "range": true,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "checkouts"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Confirmed share",
      "description": "Confirmed checkouts over all of them for the selected range. It sits a little under one minus the simulated decline rate of seatrush.payment.decline-rate, the difference being the seats lost to another buyer between the hold and the commit.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "seatrush-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "seatrush-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(seatrush_saga_duration_seconds_count{outcome=\"confirmed\"}[$__range]))\n  / sum(increase(seatrush_saga_duration_seconds_count[$__range]))",
          "range": true,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "confirmed"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.7
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.9
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "showThresholdMarkers": true
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 5,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Stuck checkouts",
      "description": "Checkouts the scheduler cannot move on its own. overdue is a deadline that has passed and has not been compensated within a pass, which means the scheduler is not keeping up rather than that a payment is slow. capture_abandoned is the one failure with no automatic answer left: the seats are sold, the money is not taken, and it needs a person. Maxed and never summed, because every pod counts the same table.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "seatrush-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "seatrush-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (reason) (seatrush_saga_stuck)",
          "range": true,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
